        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel.\n\nYou’ll spend the day in the Uco Valley wine region at the foot of the Andes.\n\nA specialist guide will take you to three well-known wineries.\n\nYou’ll learn how grapes are grown, when they’re harvested and how wine is made. The tour focuses in particular on Malbec, one of Mendoza’s best-known grape varieties.\n\nDuring the tasting, your guide will explain how to hold the glass, what to look for in the taste and aroma, and what foods go well with different wines.\n\nLunch is served at one of the wineries.\n\nThis is a full-day tour."
    },
