    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b04d5d61d358e759",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7479dce2cbfe9130a544f0c5ce8689724433944fb32da6cbdd142731b45acaa5",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-de97cc1c",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel.\n\nThe day is free, with optional activities available.\n\nWine lovers can take a tasting tour in Luján de Cuyo, a suburb of Mendoza known for its Malbec and Cabernet Sauvignon.\n\nIf you’d prefer something more active, you can go river rafting, horseback riding or cycling."
